{#
/**
 * @file
 * Dungeon Crawler Life - Front Page
 * Theme override for the front page - AI-Generated Living Dungeon
 */
#}

{{ attach_library('dungeoncrawler/animated-header') }}

<div class="page-wrapper">
  {# Animated Header Section - Full Height Home Header #}
  <div id="large-header" class="large-header home-header">
    <canvas id="demo-canvas"></canvas>
    <h1 class="main-title">
      <span class="highlight">Dungeon Crawler</span> <span class="thin">Life</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="main-subtitle">
      An AI-Generated, Procedurally Growing Dungeon Crawl — Where Every Room Is Permanent and Every Monster Has a Soul
    </p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-primary">How It Works</a>
      <a href="#the-dungeon" class="btn btn-outline-light">Explore the Depths</a>
      <a href="/user/register" class="btn btn-outline-light">Create Your Adventurer</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# Navigation - Using Radix Navbar Component #}
  {% block page_navigation %}
    {% embed 'radix:navbar' with {
      navbar_container_type: null,
      navbar_expand: 'lg',
      navbar_theme: 'dark',
      navbar_utility_classes: [
        'dungeoncrawler-navbar',
        'dungeoncrawler-navbar-front',
      ],
    } %}
      {% block branding %}
        {% if page.navbar_branding %}
          {{ page.navbar_branding }}
        {% endif %}
      {% endblock %}

      {% block left %}
        {% if page.navbar_left %}
          <div class="me-auto">
            {{ page.navbar_left }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endblock %}

      {% block right %}
        {% if page.navbar_right %}
          {{ attach_library('dungeoncrawler/navbar_right') }}
          <div class="ms-auto region-navbar-right">
            {{ page.navbar_right }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endblock %}
    {% endembed %}
  {% endblock %}

  {# Main Content #}
  <main class="main-content">
    {% if page.header %}
      <div class="header-region">
        <div class="container">
          {{ page.header }}
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="container py-5">
      {# The Living Dungeon Concept Section #}
      <section id="the-dungeon" class="mb-5">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-10 mx-auto">
            <h2 class="text-center mb-4">⚔️ The Living Dungeon</h2>
            <div class="lead text-center mb-4">
              <p>A dungeon that grows as you explore it. Every room is generated by AI the first time an adventuring party steps inside — and once created, it becomes a permanent part of the world.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="row mt-5">
              <div class="col-md-4 text-center mb-4">
                <div class="philosophy-icon mb-3">
                  <i class="fas fa-door-open fa-3x text-warning"></i>
                </div>
                <h4>Permanent Rooms</h4>
                <p>Every room is procedurally generated the moment it's first entered. Once explored, it exists forever — complete with its own traps, treasures, and secrets.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-4 text-center mb-4">
                <div class="philosophy-icon mb-3">
                  <i class="fas fa-dragon fa-3x text-danger"></i>
                </div>
                <h4>Living Monsters</h4>
                <p>Monsters and NPCs are AI-generated with unique personalities, goals, and motivations. Some respawn, some die permanently. All live their own lives within the dungeon.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-4 text-center mb-4">
                <div class="philosophy-icon mb-3">
                  <i class="fas fa-brain fa-3x text-info"></i>
                </div>
                <h4>AI Personalities</h4>
                <p>Every creature has an AI-powered personality. Negotiate with a goblin merchant, outwit a cunning lich, or befriend a lonely troll. The choice is yours.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {# How It Works Section #}
      <section id="how-it-works" class="mb-5 py-5">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-10 mx-auto">
            <h2 class="text-center mb-4">🗺️ How It Works</h2>
            <div class="lead text-center mb-4">
              <p>The dungeon is infinite, growing procedurally as adventuring parties push deeper into the unknown. AI generates every room, creature, and story moment in real-time.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="row mt-4">
              <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                <div class="card h-100">
                  <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title">
                      <i class="fas fa-hat-wizard text-warning me-2"></i>
                      Form Your Party
                    </h5>
                    <p class="card-text">Choose your character class, equip your gear, and assemble an adventuring party with other players. Warriors, mages, rogues, clerics — every role matters in the depths.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                <div class="card h-100">
                  <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title">
                      <i class="fas fa-dungeon text-warning me-2"></i>
                      Enter the Dungeon
                    </h5>
                    <p class="card-text">Step through the gates and descend. Each room you enter is generated by AI — unique architecture, atmospheric descriptions, hidden passages, and lurking dangers.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                <div class="card h-100">
                  <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title">
                      <i class="fas fa-comments text-warning me-2"></i>
                      Interact with AI Creatures
                    </h5>
                    <p class="card-text">Every monster and NPC has AI-driven personality and goals. Fight them, trade with them, interrogate them, or forge unlikely alliances. Their memories persist.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                <div class="card h-100">
                  <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title">
                      <i class="fas fa-map text-warning me-2"></i>
                      Shape the World
                    </h5>
                    <p class="card-text">Every room you explore becomes permanent. Every monster you slay stays dead. Every treasure you claim is gone. Your party's actions permanently shape the dungeon for all who follow.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {# The Creatures Section #}
      <section id="creatures" class="mb-5">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-8 mx-auto">
            <h2 class="text-center mb-4">🐉 Denizens of the Deep</h2>

            <div class="card mb-4">
              <div class="card-body">
                <h4 class="card-title">
                  <i class="fas fa-skull-crossbones text-danger me-2"></i>
                  AI-Powered Monsters
                </h4>
                <p class="card-text">Every creature in the dungeon has a unique AI personality. A spider queen might parley if you bring her a gift. A band of kobolds might flee at the sight of fire. An ancient lich might challenge you to a game of riddles before combat.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card mb-4">
              <div class="card-body">
                <h4 class="card-title">
                  <i class="fas fa-store text-warning me-2"></i>
                  NPC Merchants & Allies
                </h4>
                <p class="card-text">Not everything in the dungeon wants to kill you. AI-driven NPCs set up shop in safer corridors, offering enchanted weapons, healing potions, and cryptic rumors about deeper levels. Build reputation and they'll offer better deals.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card mb-4">
              <div class="card-body">
                <h4 class="card-title">
                  <i class="fas fa-sync-alt text-info me-2"></i>
                  Life & Death
                </h4>
                <p class="card-text mb-3">Creatures in the dungeon follow rules of life and death:</p>
                <ul>
                  <li><strong>Mortal Creatures</strong> — When slain, they're gone forever. Their loot is claimed, their territory opens up, and the dungeon remembers.</li>
                  <li><strong>Respawning Creatures</strong> — Some beasts regenerate over time, refilling cleared rooms with new threats and fresh challenges.</li>
                  <li><strong>Boss Entities</strong> — Powerful, unique creatures that guard the deepest chambers. Defeat them and earn legendary rewards.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center mt-5">
              <a href="/user/register" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
                <i class="fas fa-scroll me-2"></i>
                Begin Your Adventure
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {# Drupal Content Region #}
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col">
          {% if page.content %}
            {{ page.content }}
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  {# Footer #}
  {% if page.footer %}
    {{ page.footer }}
  {% endif %}
</div>
